{"1437760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Peripeteia", "steam_appid": 1437760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/7da051e1a9eaa8267ab24c2b0f62f5a6.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/7da051e1a9eaa8267ab24c2b0f62f5a6.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peripeteia is a cyberpunk immersive sim set in alternate-history Poland – a first-and-third-person game mixing shooter, stealth and RPG mechanics with an unexplored setting and original ideas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Marie: a cybernetic mercenary in a post-Soviet city full of corruption and opportunity, where nations, factions and ideologies clash. You will use your wits, tact, and raw violent nature to complete tasks shrouded in conspiracy and mystery. Logic, skill and ruthless cunning win the day in an interactive world – but when that fails, a loaded gun and the ability to climb virtually anywhere, will suffice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/5a4d9bf068cf1740cc131200e20cc0f5.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/5a4d9bf068cf1740cc131200e20cc0f5.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/5a4d9bf068cf1740cc131200e20cc0f5.mp4?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A CITY THAT GOES DEEPER THAN YOU THINK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels so vast they take hours to explore. Every tower, sewer, rooftop and basement is real and reachable. No quest markers. No correct path. If you can see a ledge, Marie can grab it. Forge your own routes with a sabre jammed into a wall or a well-placed crate. Get lost. Find something no one else found. That's the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/2a6f0bbbee3a9b1457b21039c4534923.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=520 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/2a6f0bbbee3a9b1457b21039c4534923.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/2a6f0bbbee3a9b1457b21039c4534923.mp4?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARM YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 weapons – Cold War surplus, prototype rarities, stolen NATO hardware. Every magazine, every bullet, every attachment exists as a physical object in your inventory. Strip enemy weapons for parts. Transfer your gear between missions. Build your stash in Marie's basement. Plan your loadout or improvise when everything goes wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6397d0e91a58f32c6591cf974df5694f.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=338 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6397d0e91a58f32c6591cf974df5694f.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6397d0e91a58f32c6591cf974df5694f.mp4?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY PROBLEM HAS MULTIPLE SOLUTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack terminals. Possess enemies. Manipulate factions against each other. Sneak through the vents, talk your way past the guards, or come in loud with a stolen PKM. Every mission is a sandbox. Your choices determine who lives, who dies, and whose flag flies over the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6689bb8748c4f1b597e368c44102a85c.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=520 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6689bb8748c4f1b597e368c44102a85c.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6689bb8748c4f1b597e368c44102a85c.mp4?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marie is living military surplus – powerful but not invincible. Manage your implants, ration your energy, scavenge what you can. The city doesn't care about you. Its factions will use you and discard you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/0b472a2803266c866eec5c3f7c199833.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=520 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/0b472a2803266c866eec5c3f7c199833.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/0b472a2803266c866eec5c3f7c199833.mp4?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOSE YOURSELF IN THE EASTERN NIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unforgettable soundtrack featuring Sewerslvt, Ed Harrison (Neotokyo, Deus Ex: Mankind Divided) and a dozen other amazing artists. Drum and bass, atmospheric ambience, breakcore. Post-Soviet brutalism rendered in the grit of the early 2000s with modern lighting. Rain on concrete. Every second of this city sounds and looks exactly as dark as it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/da67c7a5fcf582baa9facfee23e83cd3.gif?t=1785867624\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/da67c7a5fcf582baa9facfee23e83cd3.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An immersive sim for people who think the genre never got the sequel it deserved.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/7da051e1a9eaa8267ab24c2b0f62f5a6.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=500 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/7da051e1a9eaa8267ab24c2b0f62f5a6.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peripeteia is a cyberpunk immersive sim set in alternate-history Poland – a first-and-third-person game mixing shooter, stealth and RPG mechanics with an unexplored setting and original ideas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Marie: a cybernetic mercenary in a post-Soviet city full of corruption and opportunity, where nations, factions and ideologies clash. You will use your wits, tact, and raw violent nature to complete tasks shrouded in conspiracy and mystery. Logic, skill and ruthless cunning win the day in an interactive world – but when that fails, a loaded gun and the ability to climb virtually anywhere, will suffice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/5a4d9bf068cf1740cc131200e20cc0f5.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/5a4d9bf068cf1740cc131200e20cc0f5.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/5a4d9bf068cf1740cc131200e20cc0f5.mp4?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A CITY THAT GOES DEEPER THAN YOU THINK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels so vast they take hours to explore. Every tower, sewer, rooftop and basement is real and reachable. No quest markers. No correct path. If you can see a ledge, Marie can grab it. Forge your own routes with a sabre jammed into a wall or a well-placed crate. Get lost. Find something no one else found. That's the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/2a6f0bbbee3a9b1457b21039c4534923.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=520 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/2a6f0bbbee3a9b1457b21039c4534923.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/2a6f0bbbee3a9b1457b21039c4534923.mp4?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARM YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 weapons – Cold War surplus, prototype rarities, stolen NATO hardware. Every magazine, every bullet, every attachment exists as a physical object in your inventory. Strip enemy weapons for parts. Transfer your gear between missions. Build your stash in Marie's basement. Plan your loadout or improvise when everything goes wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6397d0e91a58f32c6591cf974df5694f.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=338 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6397d0e91a58f32c6591cf974df5694f.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6397d0e91a58f32c6591cf974df5694f.mp4?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY PROBLEM HAS MULTIPLE SOLUTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack terminals. Possess enemies. Manipulate factions against each other. Sneak through the vents, talk your way past the guards, or come in loud with a stolen PKM. Every mission is a sandbox. Your choices determine who lives, who dies, and whose flag flies over the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6689bb8748c4f1b597e368c44102a85c.poster.avif?t=1785867624\" width=520 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/extras/6689bb8748c4f1b597e368c44102a85c.webm?t=1785867624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/ext