deserved.</i></p>", "short_description": "You are Marie, a cyborg mercenary dropped into the rot of a post-Soviet city of corruption and opportunity. Shoot, sneak, hack, climb or talk your way through alt-history cyberpunk Poland in an immersive sim where every problem has multiple solutions and every rooftop is reachable.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“I think I might have found the true king of the genre”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“Sights capable of filling you simultaneously with dread and awe”<br>Eurogamer<br><br>“One of the most impactful and atmospheric games I have played in nearly a decade”<br>Tyler McVicker<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/header.jpg?t=1785867624", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/7f8e848883510351c137ea4c923d741a6bb4892d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785867624", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1437760/7f8e848883510351c137ea4c923d741a6bb4892d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785867624", "website": "https://90s.graphics/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Really just about anything made after 2015<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU supporting Shader Model 5<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> AMD GPUs will perform worse than Nvidia equivalents. Integrated GPUs will also struggle.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</str